           Permitted values for _X are _1 and _2. These indicate the precise time
           that the filter is to be run. To understand this concept it will be
           useful to have read the ppaamm(3) manual page. Basically, for each
           management group there are up to two ways of calling the module's
           functions. In the case of the _a_u_t_h_e_n_t_i_c_a_t_i_o_n and _s_e_s_s_i_o_n components
