           ppaamm__sseettccrreedd(3), here rruunn11 means run the filter from the
           ppaamm__aauutthheennttiiccaattee function and rruunn22 means run the filter from
           ppaamm__sseettccrreedd. In the case of the session modules, _r_u_n_1 implies that
